Step 6 — Deploy the API

PURPOSE:
Why?
Creating the method isn't enough. Deployment publishes the API configuration to a stage so clients can actually call it.
Your flow is now:
POST /devices
      ↓
API Gateway
      ↓
InterviewLambda

HANDSON:
In API Gateway:
Deploy API
Choose:
New stage
Stage name:
dev

Click Deploy.
You'll get an Invoke URL, something like:
https://xxxxx.execute-api.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/dev

Copy the Invoke URL.
